{"title":"Brigand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/brigand\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/76081a6b6cba8a6e67c9.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9b1cfb78d1f46e754be0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-4194.4px,-1688.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1792px\"><i style=\"left:4194.4px;top:1688.7px\"></i></div><figcaption>Wolfden</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"brigand\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/fdd8c032b5f277aef224.webp\" alt=\"Brigand\"></div><h3>Brigand</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>20 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–23)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}